# The build context for `apps/web/Dockerfile` and `apps/admin/Dockerfile` is the
# workspace root — both compile against the shared packages, so neither can be
# built from its own directory.
#
# Everything here is either regenerated inside the image or must never enter it.

**/node_modules
**/dist
.git
.nx
.fallow

# Vite's `envDir` is the workspace root, so a `.env` copied in would be read at
# build time and baked into the bundle.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

**/*.log
**/coverage
